# Solstice Shaders - English labels

profile.LOW=Low
profile.LOW.comment=Smaller shadow map, no SSAO or god rays, cheap clouds. For integrated graphics.
profile.MEDIUM=Medium
profile.MEDIUM.comment=Balanced quality for mid-range GPUs.
profile.HIGH=High
profile.HIGH.comment=The intended look. Default.
profile.ULTRA=Ultra
profile.ULTRA.comment=4096 shadow map, long shadow distance, high sample counts everywhere.

