option.shadowMapResolution=Shadow Resolution
option.shadowMapResolution.comment=Size of the shadow map. Higher is sharper and slower.
option.shadowDistance=Shadow Distance
option.shadowDistance.comment=How far shadows are rendered, in blocks.
option.shadowDistanceRenderMul=Shadow Render Distance
option.shadowDistanceRenderMul.comment=1.0 limits shadow casters to the shadow distance (faster). -1 renders all loaded chunks into the shadow map.
value.shadowDistanceRenderMul.-1.0=All chunks
value.shadowDistanceRenderMul.1.0=Shadow distance
option.sunPathRotation=Sun Path Angle
option.sunPathRotation.comment=Tilts the path of the sun and moon so shadows are never perfectly axis aligned.
