option.SHADOW_SAMPLES.comment=Samples used to soften shadow edges.
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS=Shadow Softness
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.comment=Size of the penumbra. Shadows get softer the further they are from their caster.
option.SHADOW_DISTORTION=Shadow Distortion
option.SHADOW_DISTORTION.comment=Concentrates shadow resolution near the player. Higher = sharper nearby, blurrier far away.
option.COLORED_SHADOWS=Coloured Shadows
